<div class="help-page">
  <h1>Accessing Information</h1>
  
  <section class="help-section">
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      This guide will help you understand how to access and retrieve information from our system.
      Whether you're looking for documents, records, or data, this page provides step-by-step instructions
      to help you find what you need.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="help-section">
    <h2>How to Access Information</h2>
    
    <h3>1. Search for Information</h3>
    <p>Use the search functionality to locate specific documents or records:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Enter keywords related to the information you're seeking</li>
      <li>Use filters to narrow down your results by date, type, or category</li>
      <li>Review the search results and select the relevant items</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. Browse by Category</h3>
    <p>Navigate through organized categories to find information:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Select a category from the main menu</li>
      <li>Browse subcategories if available</li>
      <li>Click on items to view detailed information</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>3. Request Information</h3>
    <p>If you cannot find the information you need, you can submit a formal request:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Complete the information request form</li>
      <li>Provide specific details about the information you're seeking</li>
      <li>Submit your request and await a response</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="help-section">
    <h2>Types of Information Available</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Public records and documents</li>
      <li>Case information and status updates</li>
      <li>Historical records and archives</li>
      <li>Reports and statistics</li>
      <li>Policy documents and guidelines</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="help-section">
    <h2>Privacy and Data Protection</h2>
    <p>
      We are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your personal information responsibly.
      All information access requests are processed in accordance with applicable data protection laws
      and regulations.
    </p>
    <p>
      Certain information may be restricted or redacted to protect:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Personal privacy</li>
      <li>National security</li>
      <li>Ongoing investigations</li>
      <li>Commercially sensitive information</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="help-section">
    <h2>Need Additional Help?</h2>
    <p>
      If you're having trouble accessing information or have questions about this process,
      please contact our support team:
    </p>
    <%
      contact_email = support_email || 'support@example.com'
      contact_phone = support_phone || '1-800-123-4567'
      contact_hours = support_hours || 'Monday - Friday, 9:00 AM - 5:00 PM'
    %>
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <%= link_to contact_email, "mailto:#{contact_email}" %></li>
      <li>Phone: <%= contact_phone %></li>
      <li>Hours: <%= contact_hours %></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>
